id lispex
name Lispex
creators STUDIO HAZE
tags pl
website https://www.lispex.com/
aka 리스펙스
description Lispex is a language for writing business rules, such as a publisher's house style. It cannot touch files or the network, so it is safe to run inside any program. Its Rust implementation provides a source tree interpreter and a virtual machine that verifies bytecode before execution. It is available through native executables for Windows, macOS, and Linux, npm, WebAssembly, and a browser playground. Separate embeddable evaluators accept explicit work and memory limits. Topaz embeds a Lispex evaluator.
fileExtensions lspx
writtenIn rust

docs https://www.lispex.com/v1.21/en/docs/getting-started
